ind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526038075/0001193125-26-038075-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-01-23","form":"8-K","codes":["3.02","3.03","8.01"],"events":[{"label":"Unregistered sale of equity","kind":"finance","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Holder rights modified","kind":"finance","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Other material event","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526020587/0001193125-26-020587-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-01-16","form":"8-K","codes":["3.02","3.03","8.01"],"events":[{"label":"Unregistered sale of equity","kind":"finance","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Holder rights modified","kind":"finance","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Other material event","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526014326/0001193125-26-014326-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-01-12","form":"8-K","codes":["7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526009922/0001193125-26-009922-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[{"date":"2021-12-20","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312521361394/0001193125-21-361394-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["Planet Labs PBC files with the SEC under \"Radio & Tv Broadcasting & Communications Equipment\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $315.1m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 42.1% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 53.5%.","Listed on NYSE, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 2091 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 42.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $94.2m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Gross margin of 53.5% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Net cash of $368.1m against total assets of $1.3bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 55.2% to 53.5% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-37.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $12.1m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 15.1% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 7.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (454,722 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000157285426000003/0001572854-26-000003-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.5% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000157285426000003/0001572854-26-000003-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 46.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.46,"consecutive":2,"current":0.535,"current_display":"53.5%","threshold_display":"46.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 21.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.21,"consecutive":2,"current":0.421,"current_display":"42.1%","threshold_display":"21.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"runway_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Cash runway falls below 12 months","metric":"runway_months","compari